{"seq":2,"slug":"channels-and-coding","title":"信道与编码","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/ideas-and-methods/channels-and-coding","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"channel-capacity","title":"信道容量：传输的物理极限","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/ideas-and-methods/channels-and-coding/channel-capacity","wordCount":1867,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"reliable-communication","title":"可靠的通信：把差错率逼到零","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/ideas-and-methods/channels-and-coding/reliable-communication","wordCount":1347,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"信道与编码\">信道与编码</h1><p>有了度量信息的尺子，下一个问题立刻浮现：一条真实的线路——一根铜线、一段无线电频段、一张光盘——到底能可靠地传多少信息？凭直觉，噪声越大，能传的就越少，而且无论怎么努力，差错率都不可能压到零。香农的回答彻底颠覆了这个直觉，也定义了整个通信工程此后七十年的奋斗目标。</p>\n<p>他先给出了一个硬边界：每条信道都有一个确定的最大速率，叫信道容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。这个数由信道本身的物理特性决定，是任何技巧都无法突破的天花板。对于受高斯噪声干扰、带宽为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>、信噪比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的信道，他算出了那个著名的公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>W</mi><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>S</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = W\\log_2\\!\\left(1+\\dfrac{S}{N}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——这就是&quot;香农极限&quot;。</p>\n<p>真正惊人的是第二步。香农证明了：只要你的传输速率低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，就一定存在某种编码方式，能把差错率压低到任意接近零，哪怕信道充满噪声。这就是有噪信道编码定理。它把工程师从&quot;差错不可避免&quot;的宿命中解放出来，告诉他们差错是可以被工程手段彻底击败的——前提是别贪心，别超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>这一章两篇文章对应这两步。第一篇讲信道容量，看香农如何为&quot;能传多少&quot;定出物理上限，以及这个上限如何成了 5G、Wi-Fi、深空通信至今仍在逼近的标尺。第二篇讲可靠通信，拆解编码定理这个&quot;存在性奇迹&quot;为什么成立、它为什么是存在性证明而非构造方法，以及由此引出的纠错码、数据压缩与冗余之间的深刻权衡。</p>\n<p>读完你会明白，今天每一次扫码不出错、每一通电话听得清，背后都是香农这两条定理在默默兜底。</p>\n"}